== 2026-10-31 pgp series: detailed five-tier pagoda (operator reference) ==
Prompt: pagoda per community-post reference (tiles, eave brackets, red columns,
glowing windows, stone base, pond reflection), balls-style one-shot framing.
B2003 qwen3.8-flash-next IQ3_S, 5 seeds: files 5/5; render w/o JS errors 1/5;
observed motion 1/5. pgp1: rAF 131/6s, motion 3.0-4.2%/step, 0 console errors.
Visual checklist vs reference: 6/9 (missing tiles + pond reflection).
Failure modes: unimported addon (Reflector), syntax, read-only position write.
Conclusion: longer task text => longer program => higher one-shot JS breakage;
detail-heavy requests need the code contour (run, catch TypeError, repair loop),
not a bigger prompt.
Contour pass on pgp failures: pgp2 (TypeError: THREE.Reflector is not a constructor) repaired by
code-only fixer (insert addon import + constructor alias), re-validated: renders, 0 errors.
Other classes need re-generation not patching. Contour value on browser code confirmed for
missing-import class (deterministic), not for semantic/syntax damage.

